{"q":"/types/76?lang=it","data":{"id":76,"url":"https://it.numista.com/76","title":"50 Euro Cents - Albert II (1st map, 1st type, 1st portrait)","object_type":{"id":1,"name":"Moneta di circolazione regolare"},"issuer":{"code":"belgique","name":"Belgium"},"min_year":1999,"max_year":2006,"ruler":[{"id":1170,"name":"Alberto II","wikidata_id":"Q3911","group":{"id":530,"name":"Casa del Belgio"}}],"value":{"text":"50 Centesimi di Euro","numeric_value":0.5,"currency":{"id":9003,"name":"Euro","full_name":"Euro (2002-oggi)"}},"issue_terms":{"is_issued":true,"issue_date":"2002-01-01"},"demonetization":{"is_demonetized":false},"size":24.25,"thickness":2.38,"shape":"Rotonda","composition":{"text":"Oro nordico\n"},"technique":{"text":"Fresato"},"obverse":{"engravers":["Jan Alfons Keustermans (Jake)"],"description":"Il ritratto di profilo a sinistra del re Alberto II è circondato dalle dodici stelle d'Europa, tra le quali si trova il suo monogramma: una \"A\" maiuscola con il numero romano \"II\" sotto una corona.","lettering":"A II 2004","lettering_scripts":[{"name":"Latino"}],"picture":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/belgique/605d6a136bc2f3.10150438-original.jpg","thumbnail":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/belgique/605d6a136bc2f3.10150438-180.jpg","picture_copyright":"Mike Bentley","picture_license_name":"CC BY-NC","picture_license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.it"},"reverse":{"engravers":["Luc Luycx"],"description":"Una mappa, accanto al valore nominale, simboleggia la riunione delle quindici nazioni dell'Unione Europea","lettering":"50 EURO CENT LL","lettering_scripts":[{"name":"Latino"}],"picture":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/belgique/605d6a140758b0.47306112-original.jpg","thumbnail":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/belgique/605d6a140758b0.47306112-180.jpg","picture_copyright":"Mike Bentley","picture_license_name":"CC BY-NC","picture_license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/deed.it"},"comments":"<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">FDC 1999 - 2001</span></span></span><br />\r\nSet introduzione dell'euro con monete dal 1999 al 2001<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/63936acc26541.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/63936acc26541.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"111\" /></a></span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">FDC 2002</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - Set annuale in cofanetto - gli Speroni d'oro a 100.000 + 1 medaglia (700 anni della battaglia degli Speroni d'oro: 1302 - 2002)<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5544c8ffc.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5544c8ffc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"103\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - Addio al franco, benvenuto all'euro, 20.000 esemplari<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5552d0539.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5552d0539.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"143\" /></a><br />\r\n3 - CM ciclismo su strada, 20.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2003</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - 50 anni di TV in Belgio + 1 medaglia (50 anni di TV in Belgio) 100.000 copie<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b515bcda37.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b515bcda37.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"188\" height=\"250\" /></a><br />\r\n2- 100 anni di Ford, 15.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br />\r\n3 - Nascita, 10.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br />\r\n4 - Matrimonio, 10.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2004</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - 140 anni di Croce Rossa 60.000 copie + 1 medaglia classica<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b5dba80e18.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b5dba80e18.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"111\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - 140 anni della Croce Rossa + 1 medaglia con la croce dipinta di rosso, 2.000 esemplari<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br />\r\n3 - Nascita, 10.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br />\r\n4 - Matrimonio 10.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2005</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - Grand' Place + 1 medaglia non colorata 38 000 copie<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b609c5a7fa.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b609c5a7fa.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"94\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - Grand' Place + 1 medaglia colorata 2 000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">BU 2006</span></span></span><br />\r\n1 - Beguinages fiamminghi + 1 medaglia non colorata 38 000 copie<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5f7b61958ae38.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5f7b61958ae38.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"105\" /></a><br />\r\n2 - I beghinaggi fiamminghi + 1 medaglia colorata a 2.000 copie<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">immagine da trovare</span>","related_types":[{"id":6291,"title":"50 Euro Cents - Albert II (2nd map, 1st type, 1st portrait)","category":"coin","country":{"code":"belgique","name":"Belgium"},"minYear":2007,"maxYear":2007},{"id":6306,"title":"50 Euro Cents - Albert II (2nd map, 2nd type, 2nd portrait)","category":"coin","country":{"code":"belgique","name":"Belgium"},"minYear":2008,"maxYear":2008},{"id":6307,"title":"50 Euro Cents - Albert II (2nd map, 2nd type, 1st portrait)","category":"coin","country":{"code":"belgique","name":"Belgium"},"minYear":2009,"maxYear":2013}],"tags":["Carta geografica","Monarca","Monogramma"],"references":[{"catalogue":{"id":3,"code":"KM"},"number":"229"},{"catalogue":{"id":192,"code":"LA"},"number":"BEM-6.1"},{"catalogue":{"id":24,"code":"Schön"},"number":"207"}],"weight":7.8,"orientation":"medal","edge":{"description":"Rientrato","picture":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/belgique/69a85c66d22555.70235147-original.jpg","thumbnail":"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/photos/belgique/69a85c66d22555.70235147-180.jpg","picture_copyright":"Cyrillius"},"mints":[{"id":1338,"name":"Royal Mint of Belgium"}],"category":"coin","type":"Moneta di circolazione regolare"}}